id: DRAFT-libini_config-1.4.0-poisoned-profile-prebuilt-configure-triple-pitfall
trigger_tool: configure|make|install
phase: configuration|testing|installation
error_signature: /data/service/hnp/bin/bash: inaccessible or not found|C compiler cannot create executables|pkg-config not found|install-dist_docDATA.*Error 64
severity: 3
category: autotools, build-system, ohos, testing, compat
match_keywords: pkg_config, pkgconf, config_shell, install_shim, CC, CONFIG_SHELL
title: 毒化profile下Autotools预生成configure三连坑：CONFIG_SHELL与CC实测兜底加PKG_CONFIG指向pkgconf真名加runtime install多文件覆盖
root_cause: ohos-aarch64 profile把SHELL/CONFIG_SHELL钉为真机不可访问的/data/service/hnp/bin/bash且把CC钉为部分机器不可见的/data/service/hnp/bin/clang，预生成configure遇非空CONFIG_SHELL即重exec坏shell，裸直调又丢工具链标志致Error 77；pkgconf包只装pkgconf真名而configure以AC_PATH_TOOL单名探测pkg-config；HMBS runtime bin/install包装器多文件DATA安装报EX_USAGE/64
affected_scope: 自带预生成configure且依赖pkg-config探测与make install多文件安装的Autotools类C/C++库
verification_cmd: 真机conan日志确认configure越过139行坏bash重exec且clang系列检查为yes且checking for pkg-config命中pkgconf，make check出现# FAIL: 0且package阶段无install-dist_docDATA Error 64，门禁passed
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: prebuilt-configure-shell-cc-pkgconf-install-override
rec_description: 删autoreconf直用预生成configure，以/bin/sh内联前缀覆盖毒化SHELL/CONFIG_SHELL并实测可用CC单token透传，双通道指向PKG_CONFIG=pkgconf真名，package期探测可用install覆盖INSTALL，保留工具链与测试口径
rec_command: archives/l/libini_config/1.4.0/conanfile.py: 删autoconf/automake/libtool申报与0003补丁，_inline_prefix内联SHELL/CONFIG_SHELL/CC/PKG_CONFIG，generate加tool_requires pkgconf/3.0.5并define PKG_CONFIG，package追加探测INSTALL覆盖；test_package/: 计数发射双通道标记
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: toolchain-env-only-shell-override
fallback_description: 若真机已修复profile毒化则退回标准Autotools helper仅保留environment级SHELL/CONFIG_SHELL钉选，不保留手动直调与install覆盖
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: tool_requires.*autoconf|autoreconf|CONFIG_SHELL=.*/data/service/hnp/bin/bash
forbid_1_reason: 禁止为打configure.ac补丁重新引入autoreconf自举链与沿用毒化hnp bash路径，会重现m4重建失败与configure[139] Error 127
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检回退到m4构建失败或configure重exec坏shell，门禁not_passed
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libini_config-1.4.0-poisoned-profile-prebuilt-configure-triple-pitfall.md
last_updated: 2026-10-17
source_event: libini_config/1.4.0 真机预检毒化profile三连坑定位与全部门禁通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 16292
